# Force LF for build-critical files so a Windows working copy never commits
# CRLF that would break the macOS/Linux CI (e.g. a `#!/bin/bash\r` shebang or
# a CRLF Makefile). The repo stores LF; CI checks out LF.
*.sh    text eol=lf
*.py    text eol=lf
*.m     text eol=lf
*.h     text eol=lf
*.c     text eol=lf
Makefile text eol=lf
*.yml   text eol=lf
*.plist text eol=lf
*.entitlements text eol=lf
